{"seq":2,"slug":"haptic-hardware","title":"触觉硬件：从偏心转子到音圈与可编程阻力","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-haptics-feedback/foundations/haptic-hardware","wordCount":1439,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"触觉硬件-从偏心转子到音圈与可编程阻力\">触觉硬件：从偏心转子到音圈与可编程阻力</h1><p>同样一行&quot;播放命中震动&quot;的代码，在 Xbox 手柄上是一阵粗糙的嗡嗡，在 DualSense 上却是一记带回弹的清脆顿挫——差别不在代码，在手柄里那块作动器。不理解硬件，你写出的触觉资产要么在高端设备上浪费了能力，要么在廉价设备上根本播不出来。这一篇拆开各类作动器，讲清每种的物理原理、能渲染什么、不能渲染什么，为后面所有信号与设计决策划定物理边界。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-作动器决定可表达的维度\">核心概念：作动器决定可表达的维度</h2><p>触觉作动器把电信号转成机械运动，但不同结构能转出的运动维度天差地别。理解它们的关键是三个指标：能否独立控制频率、上升时间（从静止到全幅有多快）、以及输出的是振动还是定向力。下图按这三个维度把主流作动器归类。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    ACT[触觉作动器] --&gt; VIB[振动类&lt;br/&gt;输出周期性位移]&#10;    ACT --&gt; FORCE[力反馈类&lt;br/&gt;输出定向阻力]&#10;    VIB --&gt; ERM[ERM 偏心转子&lt;br/&gt;频率与振幅耦合&lt;br/&gt;上升慢]&#10;    VIB --&gt; LRA[LRA 线性谐振&lt;br/&gt;固定谐振频率&lt;br/&gt;上升快]&#10;    VIB --&gt; VCA[VCA 音圈&lt;br/&gt;频率振幅独立&lt;br/&gt;宽频高清]&#10;    FORCE --&gt; AT[自适应扳机&lt;br/&gt;蜗杆齿轮&lt;br/&gt;可编程阻力]&#10;    ERM --&gt; CHEAP[廉价手柄/手机基础震动]&#10;    LRA --&gt; PHONE[iPhone Taptic/Switch]&#10;    VCA --&gt; DS[DualSense 高清触觉]&#10;    AT --&gt; DS2[DualSense L2/R2]\">flowchart TD\n    ACT[触觉作动器] --&gt; VIB[振动类&lt;br/&gt;输出周期性位移]\n    ACT --&gt; FORCE[力反馈类&lt;br/&gt;输出定向阻力]\n    VIB --&gt; ERM[ERM 偏心转子&lt;br/&gt;频率与振幅耦合&lt;br/&gt;上升慢]\n    VIB --&gt; LRA[LRA 线性谐振&lt;br/&gt;固定谐振频率&lt;br/&gt;上升快]\n    VIB --&gt; VCA[VCA 音圈&lt;br/&gt;频率振幅独立&lt;br/&gt;宽频高清]\n    FORCE --&gt; AT[自适应扳机&lt;br/&gt;蜗杆齿轮&lt;br/&gt;可编程阻力]\n    ERM --&gt; CHEAP[廉价手柄/手机基础震动]\n    LRA --&gt; PHONE[iPhone Taptic/Switch]\n    VCA --&gt; DS[DualSense 高清触觉]\n    AT --&gt; DS2[DualSense L2/R2]</pre><p>注意右侧分支：自适应扳机不属于振动类，它输出的是持续的定向阻力，是一种力反馈，需要完全不同的资源模型，详见<a href=\"../systems/adaptive-triggers\">自适应扳机</a>。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>作动器</th>\n<th>频率控制</th>\n<th>上升时间</th>\n<th>高清纹理</th>\n<th>典型功耗</th>\n<th>代表设备</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>ERM 偏心转子</td>\n<td>与振幅耦合，不可独立</td>\n<td>慢（数十 ms）</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>旧手柄、廉价手机</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>LRA 线性谐振</td>\n<td>固定谐振点附近</td>\n<td>快（约 1ms）</td>\n<td>部分</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>iPhone、Switch Joy-Con</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>VCA 音圈</td>\n<td>宽频独立可控</td>\n<td>极快</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>DualSense</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>自适应扳机马达</td>\n<td>不适用（输出力非振动）</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>不适用</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>DualSense L2/R2</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"erm-最老也最受限的偏心转子\">ERM：最老也最受限的偏心转子</h2><p>偏心转子马达（Eccentric Rotating Mass）是一个轴上挂着偏心配重的小直流电机。通电后电机旋转，偏心配重产生离心力，让整个手柄抖动。它的致命约束是：频率和振幅被电机转速死死绑在一起——想震得更强只能转得更快，而转得更快频率也跟着升高，你无法独立控制&quot;低频强震&quot;或&quot;高频轻颤&quot;。</p>\n<p>更糟的是它的上升时间。从静止到全速旋转需要几十毫秒，停下来也要靠惯性慢慢衰减，所以 ERM 根本做不出干脆的瞬态&quot;哒&quot;声。这就是为什么老手柄的震动只能是一团模糊的嗡嗡——它在物理上无法表达<a href=\"haptic-signal-model\">触觉信号模型</a>里那些尖锐的包络。对今天的工程意义是：ERM 是能力地板，任何跨平台触觉资产都必须能优雅降级到&quot;只有一个强弱可调的嗡嗡&quot;，这一降级逻辑在<a href=\"../systems/cross-platform-haptics\">跨平台触觉抽象</a>里是核心问题。</p>\n<h2 id=\"lra-线性谐振与-轻敲-的诞生\">LRA：线性谐振与&quot;轻敲&quot;的诞生</h2><p>线性谐振作动器（Linear Resonant Actuator）用一块沿单轴往复运动的质量块加弹簧加音圈，靠交流驱动让质量块在其谐振频率附近振动。相比 ERM 它有两大飞跃：上升时间降到约 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mtext> </mtext><mtext>ms</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1\\,\\text{ms}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">ms</span></span></span></span></span></span>，能造出干脆的瞬态；功耗也低得多，适合手机这种电池设备。iPhone 的 Taptic Engine 和 Switch Joy-Con 的&quot;HD 振动&quot;都是 LRA。</p>\n<p>LRA 的限制在于它有一个固定的谐振频率 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>f</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f_0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1076em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，偏离这个频率输出效率会急剧下降：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>输出幅度</mtext><mo>∝</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msqrt><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>f</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><msub><mi>f</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mn>2</mn></msup><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>f</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>Q</mi><msub><mi>f</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></msqrt></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{输出幅度} \\propto \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{(1-(f/f_0)^2)^2 + (f/(Q f_0))^2}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">输出幅度</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∝</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.4514em;vertical-align:-1.13em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3214em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.175em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord sqrt\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.935em;\"><span class=\"svg-align\" style=\"top:-3.2em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.2em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"padding-left:1em;\"><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1076em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\"><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7401em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.989em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\"><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7401em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.989em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1076em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mclose\"><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7401em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.989em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.895em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.2em;\"></span><span class=\"hide-tail\" style=\"min-width:1.02em;height:1.28em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"1.28em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 1296\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin slice\"><path d=\"M263,681c0.7,0,18,39.7,52,119\nc34,79.3,68.167,158.7,102.5,238c34.3,79.3,51.8,119.3,52.5,120\nc340,-704.7,510.7,-1060.3,512,-1067\nl0 -0\nc4.7,-7.3,11,-11,19,-11\nH40000v40H1012.3\ns-271.3,567,-271.3,567c-38.7,80.7,-84,175,-136,283c-52,108,-89.167,185.3,-111.5,232\nc-22.3,46.7,-33.8,70.3,-34.5,71c-4.7,4.7,-12.3,7,-23,7s-12,-1,-12,-1\ns-109,-253,-109,-253c-72.7,-168,-109.3,-252,-110,-252c-10.7,8,-22,16.7,-34,26\nc-22,17.3,-33.3,26,-34,26s-26,-26,-26,-26s76,-59,76,-59s76,-60,76,-60z\nM1001 80h400000v40h-400000z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.305em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.13em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>Q</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Q</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span></span></span></span></span> 是品质因数。<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span></span></span></span></span> 离 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>f</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f_0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1076em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 越远，分母越大、幅度越小。所以 LRA 擅长在 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>f</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f_0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1076em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 附近做强烈瞬态，却难以做宽频的纹理变化——它能给你一记漂亮的&quot;哒&quot;，但给不了泥地与铁板之间细腻的质感差。iOS 上如何在 LRA 约束下设计触觉，见<a href=\"../practice/mobile-web-haptics\">移动与网页触觉</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"vca-音圈与高清触觉\">VCA：音圈与高清触觉</h2><p>音圈作动器（Voice Coil Actuator）的结构与扬声器同源：磁场中的线圈通电产生洛伦兹力，驱动质量块按输入波形运动。关键区别在于它不像 LRA 那样只有单一谐振点，而是能在较宽频段内独立地、按任意波形驱动——这正是 DualSense&quot;高清触觉&quot;的来源，也是它能让帕奇尼小体感知细腻颗粒（见<a href=\"why-haptics\">为何触觉反馈</a>中的频率响应）的物理基础。</p>\n<p>因为 VCA 直接吃波形，它和音频几乎是同一类设备——你可以把一段音频信号经过滤波后直接喂给 VCA 当触觉，这层等价关系是<a href=\"../design/haptics-audio-analogy\">触觉与音频类比</a>的硬件依据。代价是 VCA 对驱动信号和功率管理要求更高，且高清细节在玩家手汗、握持松紧不同的情况下不一定稳定可感，这要求设计上保留鲁棒的核心触感。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>作动器的三个关键指标是频率独立性、上升时间、输出类型（振动 vs 定向力），它们划定了触觉的物理表达边界。</li>\n<li>ERM 频率振幅耦合、上升慢，只能做模糊嗡嗡，是跨平台必须能降级到的能力地板。</li>\n<li>LRA 上升快、功耗低、能做干脆瞬态，但受单一谐振频率约束，难做宽频纹理；是手机与 Switch 的主力。</li>\n<li>VCA 音圈宽频独立可控、与扬声器同源，是 DualSense 高清触觉的基础，也让音转触在硬件层成立。</li>\n<li>自适应扳机输出的是可编程阻力而非振动，是独立的力反馈维度。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><ul>\n<li>作动器为何要工作在特定频段：<a href=\"why-haptics\">为何触觉反馈</a></li>\n<li>把波形喂给作动器的信号表达：<a href=\"haptic-signal-model\">触觉信号模型</a></li>\n<li>各作动器能力如何在跨平台层协商与降级：<a href=\"../systems/cross-platform-haptics\">跨平台触觉抽象</a></li>\n<li>跨库：VCA 与音频同源，音频侧的合成与采样见 <a href=\"../../game-audio/sound-design/synthesis-sampling\">合成与采样</a></li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"触觉硬件：从偏心转子到音圈与可编程阻力","id":"触觉硬件-从偏心转子到音圈与可编程阻力"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：作动器决定可表达的维度","id":"核心概念-作动器决定可表达的维度"},{"level":2,"text":"ERM：最老也最受限的偏心转子","id":"erm-最老也最受限的偏心转子"},{"level":2,"text":"LRA：线性谐振与\"轻敲\"的诞生","id":"lra-线性谐振与-轻敲-的诞生"},{"level":2,"text":"VCA：音圈与高清触觉","id":"vca-音圈与高清触觉"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读","id":"延伸阅读"}],"prev":{"title":"为何触觉反馈：把震动当成一条信息通道","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-haptics-feedback/foundations/why-haptics"},"next":{"title":"触觉信号模型：把震动当作可计算的时域波形","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-haptics-feedback/foundations/haptic-signal-model"}}